{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S08、S11、S12这类仅20—25秒的段落里，短话句和感受层仍然偏密；即使能迅速抓住重点，也未必来得及消化全部细节，X在这些段落更从容。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把叙事拆成容易迅速抓住的短句，并用【】突出每段的关键转折，感受词又随音乐段落出现，不必同时处理所有信息。更重要的是，它把具体的音乐变化、身体反应和人物心理联系起来，让人理解他为什么一边怀念亲近、一边不愿回去，以及最后如何带着想念继续生活。X的叙事也清楚，但右侧短词较多停留在情绪标签层面，音乐细节与人物心理之间的对应不如Y具体。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "db59f1a6-323d-4f7e-af96-29f16f47fa49", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T182728367803Z", "elapsed_seconds": 106.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:29:15.010457+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "509c24ea52cc901d2fa96e9003d82690748f25f58690f45e8ee0331d40af7274", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgp